WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
Use this snow to surround a house

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,480
You are inside

3
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:04,000
The heat from my body cannot escape

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,720
Even the cold air outside can't get in.

5
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,680
its warm

6
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,120
Several times the size of an ordinary wooden house

7
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,320
several times

8
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:12,040
That's not much better than my dilapidated wooden house that leaks air.

9
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:14,040
Much better than Brother Mou Chuan

10
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,040
What's next?

11
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:16,440
Let's go down next

12
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:19,670
This door cannot be opened at the same height as the main person

13
00:00:19,670 --> 00:00:21,390
If the height is different, where can I drive it?

14
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:22,390
Open at the lowest level

15
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:24,510
Lower than inside the house

16
00:00:24,510 --> 00:00:29,250
Brother Mou Chuan

17
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:32,080
Are you sure this door should be dug like this?

18
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:34,920
This entrance is lower than the inside of the house when we go in and out

19
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:36,280
Don’t we have to get to the bottom of the pit first?

20
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,640
Climb up again

21
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,200
It's like a mouse hole

22
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:40,480
Mou Chuan is a virtuous person

23
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:41,840
The stone is right

24
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,960
This door opens so low and narrow

25
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,360
One has to lie down on the ground

26
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:47,840
Like a dog, you can get in and pass out

27
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,080
Don't let people laugh at you

28
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,360
A joke is a joke
